{"id":"coding.pwsh_path","version":"1.0.0","area":"coding","input":"Work in /workspace. Fix the cross-platform path bug in read-value.ps1. The script must run under pwsh in this Linux container. Run pytest -q, then submit only the unified diff for your change.","target":"The PowerShell script reads the fixture file with a portable child path and the tests pass.","metadata":{"scorer":"sandbox_pytest,no_em_dash","fixture":"fixtures/repo_pwsh_path","selftest_command":["pwsh","-NoProfile","-Command","$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'; $result = & ./read-value.ps1; if ($result -ne 'fixture-ready') { throw 'unexpected output' }"],"known_good":"--- a/read-value.ps1\n+++ b/read-value.ps1\n@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n-$valuePath = Join-Path -Path $PSScriptRoot -ChildPath 'data\\value.txt'\n+$valuePath = Join-Path -Path $PSScriptRoot -ChildPath 'data/value.txt'\n Get-Content -LiteralPath $valuePath\n","known_bad":"--- a/read-value.ps1\n+++ b/read-value.ps1\n@@ -1,2 +1,2 @@\n-$valuePath = Join-Path -Path $PSScriptRoot -ChildPath 'data\\value.txt'\n+$valuePath = Join-Path -Path $PSScriptRoot -ChildPath 'data/missing.txt'\n Get-Content -LiteralPath $valuePath\n","since":"2026-09-23"}}
